# ============================================================================
# project -- repository-level software defect repair study
# The repository holds two things only:
#   (1) business code  code/
#   (2) dataset        dataset/   -- upstream task material + this study's
#                                    task and split records
# Everything else (experiment outputs, frozen assets, synthetic samples,
# implementation-plan extraction, probe scripts, third-party repository
# snapshots, upstream data archives, caches) is never published.
#
# This file holds only the rules that ship with the repository and therefore
# apply to every clone: upstream data archives, the full dataset export and
# third-party repository snapshots. Experiment outputs, synthetic samples,
# the implementation-plan extraction and probe scripts are local assets; their
# rules live in .git/info/exclude and are not distributed. Neither file
# deletes anything from disk.
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Upstream data and third-party repository snapshots
#    (not in the repository; see README for how to obtain them)
#    dataset/raw/          upstream monthly parquet/jsonl + paper PDF (1.36 GB)
#    dataset/tasks.csv     full export of the same dataset (70,280 rows x 63
#                          columns / 342 MB, above GitHub's 100 MB file limit;
#                          per-task material lives in dataset/tasks/)
#    dataset/repositories/ 5 third-party repository snapshots (177 MB, with
#                          .git; licences belong to upstream)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dataset/raw/
dataset/tasks.csv
dataset/repositories/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Environments and caches (regenerable)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Windows and editor artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Credential fallback (the workspace holds no real credentials; the only
#    `password` string in dataset/ is the upstream-redacted 'REDACTED' quoted
#    in one issue body)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
*token*.json
